# Pairs with TypeOK. The hand-off window budget is dropped, so the foreign author
# opens more windows than the vocabulary's domain declares; the mutation checks
# that the bound on windows is real.
MODULE: TypeOkWindowsUnbounded
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the foreign author opens windows past the budget

--- FIND
    /\ ~hoOpen
    /\ windows < MaxWindows
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~hoOpen
--- END
